# Secrets the sync Worker reads. All optional: without them push and the
# census are off and sync still works. Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`,
# or set them with `wrangler secret put NAME` on your own Worker.
# APNS_KEY=
# APNS_KEY_ID=
# APNS_TEAM=
# APNS_HOST=
# FCM_PROJECT_ID=
# FCM_CLIENT_EMAIL=
# FCM_PRIVATE_KEY=
# CENSUS_TOKEN=
